tools/ffmpeg-*/
tools/*.tar.xz

# Bulk research corpora. These are FETCHED, never authored, and they are large enough to
# fill the 221 GB boot SSD (CVQAD alone is 18 GB at 138/249 clips — it did exactly that on
# 2026-08-21). They now live on the external drive and are symlinked in; the symlink itself
# is ignored too. See "Research corpora & scratch data" in AGENTS.md.
data/cvqad
bpp-lab/node_modules/

# The bulk audit dumps (2026-07-31 snapshot, ~50 MB of six JSON files). Kept ON DISK — they
# are a frozen snapshot and the .py scripts beside them can only regenerate a CURRENT library,
# not July's — but deliberately NOT in git: they are machine-generated, never edited, and never
# diffed. The authored analysis in that folder (*.md, *.txt, *.py, *.csv) IS committed, as are
# the small config dumps (*_profiles.json, *_customformats.json, series.json, sonarr_series.json).
# A fresh clone will not have these six; re-dump with raw/dump_library.py + raw/dump_arr.py.
docs/audit-2026-07-31/raw/episodes.json
docs/audit-2026-07-31/raw/movies.json
docs/audit-2026-07-31/raw/library_flat.json
docs/audit-2026-07-31/raw/library_scored.json
